  "quotes": [
    {
      "block": "原句1",
      "no": 1,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "I spent the next two weeks perfecting my map, and making an assload of enchanted plates. I managed not to let myself jum",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 21
        }
      ],
      "words": 39
    },
    {
      "block": "原句2",
      "no": 2,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "I found myself missing him when he was gone, even though I didn't want to admit it. My bed was too big, and too empty. M",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 1068
        }
      ],
      "words": 30
    },
    {
      "block": "原句3",
      "no": 3,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "\"I'm going back into the penitentiary tonight. It's just a little rescue mission. I'll be in and out in an hour or two.\"",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 2916
        }
      ],
      "words": 23
    },
    {
      "block": "原句4",
      "no": 4,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "The mate bond. The penitentiary's magic isolates the prisoners from their loved ones. It can't erase the bond, but it ma",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 4353
        }
      ],
      "words": 23
    },
    {
      "block": "原句5",
      "no": 5,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "The magic had adapted by thickening in other spots, the power migrating to wherever it could. It had adapted to keep up ",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 6013
        }
      ],
      "words": 35
    },
    {
      "block": "原句6",
      "no": 6,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Someone had been attacking it. Trying to destroy it. Potentially, for a long fucking time",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 6195
        }
      ],
      "words": 15
    },
    {
      "block": "原句7",
      "no": 7,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "I was going to have to unravel the whole penitentiary's magic. It was going to take a long fucking time, it was going to",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 6645
        }
      ],
      "words": 46
    },
    {
      "block": "原句8",
      "no": 8,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "\"If we kill the angel who built it, does the prison fall?\" Reaper asked, his dark eyes calculating and his lips curving ",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 10605
        }
      ],
      "words": 24
    },
    {
      "block": "原句9",
      "no": 9,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "I wasn't powerless anymore. I was fallen. My magic was more dangerous than any man who wanted me dead",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 10802
        }
      ],
      "words": 19
    },
    {
      "block": "原句10",
      "no": 10,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "\"If you try to kill me, no one's making it out of here,\" I warned. \"The elevator won't work if I'm dead.\"",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 12794
        }
      ],
      "words": 22
    },
    {
      "block": "原句11",
      "no": 11,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "I've only been thinking about one. I might have enough magic for two trips, but I have a hundred people. I can't fit fif",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 15839
        }
      ],
      "words": 27
    },
    {
      "block": "原句12",
      "no": 12,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Send the first batch up. I'm coming down with the elevator afterward. We'll get everyone to the surface, even if I have ",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 17259
        }
      ],
      "words": 27
    },
    {
      "block": "原句13",
      "no": 13,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "\"My mate snuck down here to break you fuckers out without my permission,\" he said flatly",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 20582
        }
      ],
      "words": 16
    },
    {
      "block": "原句14",
      "no": 14,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "\"The wall's going to break. I need you to close us in the elevator.\"",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 28765
        }
      ],
      "words": 14
    },
    {
      "block": "原句15",
      "no": 15,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "\"You can do this,\" he said into my mind. Somehow, his lingering anger was the anchor I needed to keep going",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 30438
        }
      ],
      "words": 21
    }
  ],
